  <revision rev="6" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>7550735c38bcb395545cd5e934d39158</srcmd5>
    <version>2.1.5</version>
    <time>1789395787</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 2.1.5:
  * Version 2.1.5
  * Fix for Linux 6.18
  * Bump to version 2.1.4
  * Update README
  * Remove vidioc_g/s callback
  * Replace queryctrl with query_ext_ctrl
  * Linux 6.15 support
  * Drop Kernel versions &lt; 4.0.0
  * Remove unhelpful and potentially verbose log
  * Allow USBMUXD overrides
- Switch packaging from static tarball to _service (obs_scm + tar +
  recompress + set_version), matching the automated version-tracking
  pipeline already used in home:itachi_re
- Change upstream source from the aramg/droidcam fork to the official
  dev47apps/droidcam-linux-client repository
- Update to 2.1.5
- Drop 0001-Use-icon-installed-to-theme-directory.patch: &lt;verified
  obsolete against current upstream / no longer applies cleanly&gt;
- Drop 0003-Hack-backwards-compatibility-for-TurboJPEG-2.0.0.patch:
  &lt;same — state the actual reason once confirmed&gt;
- Drop README-v4l2loopback.md doc file.
- Switch appindicator dependency from appindicator3-0.1 to
  ayatana-appindicator3-0.1 with -DUSE_AYATANA_APPINDICATOR
- Add libusbmuxd-2.0 pkgconfig fallback for newer libusbmuxd versions
</comment>
    <requestid>1377769</requestid>
  </revision>
